@startuml
[*] --> Idle : Initial State
Idle -->|Press Button| Adjusting Hour : Switch to hour setting
Adjusting Hour -->|Press Button| Adjusting Minutes : Switch to minute setting
Adjusting Minutes -->|Press Button| Setting Alarm Hour : Switch to alarm hour setting
Setting Alarm Hour -->|Press Button| Setting Alarm Minutes : Switch to alarm minute setting
Idle -->|Set Alarm Time Matches Current Time| Alarm Triggered : Alarm triggered
Alarm On/Off -->|Set Alarm Time Matches Current Time| Alarm Triggered : Alarm turned on and set alarm time matches current time
Adjusting Hour -->|Increase Value| Adjusting Hour : Increase hour value
Adjusting Minutes -->|Increase Value| Adjusting Minutes : Increase minute value
Setting Alarm Hour -->|Increase Value| Setting Alarm Hour : Increase alarm hour value
Setting Alarm Minutes -->|Increase Value| Setting Alarm Minutes : Increase alarm minute value
Alarm Triggered -->|Press Specific Button| Idle : Stop alarm
Light On/Off -->|Press Button| Light On/Off : Toggle light feature
Idle -->[*] : Final State
@enduml
